---------- TRANSIENT CONTROL -----------
File to write input parameters to control transient simulations

Input parameters:
	t_0 -> starting time (seconds)
	t_fin -> finish time (seconds)
	dt_print -> for every dt_print seconds simulated (starting
	            at t_0) the results will be printed into a .vtr file
	         -> independently of this parameter, the results 
					    for the last timestep will always be printed
	         -> warning: avoid very small values of dt_time that
					    may be smaller than the dt of the time discretization
					 -> if only the last timestep is to be printed, 
					    set dt_print > (t_fin - t_0)
	IntegrationScheme -> options: Euler, AB2
----------------------------------------

t_0 0

t_fin 1.5

dt_print 0.1

IntegrationScheme AB2

